			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401430301,
					"content": "事不宜迟，直接来试试吧。基本的烹饪应该不用我多嘴。要注意的无非就是每桌不同的需求，不要记混了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "言笑"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430302,
					"content": "嘿嘿，还有我帮着记呢！你就放一百个心吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430303,
					"content": "一天过去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430304,
					"content": "呃…到几号桌了…一号桌的客人要葱不要辣，二号桌的要辣不要葱…三号桌…三号桌要辣不要辣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430305,
						401430306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430305,
					"content": "客人都吃完了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430307,
					"content": "…欸！我、我刚刚是在梦游吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430308,
					"content": "你从中途开始就在说胡话了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430309,
					"content": "呜…中间连休息的时间都没有，我的脑子都快变成浆糊了。你们客栈平时有这么多人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430310,
					"content": "最近还在旺季嘛，你们这是头一次在店里掌勺吧，已经做得很不错了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "言笑"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430311,
					"content": "不过还好这次来的都是熟面孔，也没有提什么偏门的需求，不然怕是会更麻烦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "言笑"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430312,
					"content": "这些需求还不算偏吗！杏仁豆腐上面居然要淋一勺酱油，连我都没这么吃过！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430313,
					"content": "哈哈，天下那么大，每个人的口味都不一样，能包容一切，才是璃月菜的精髓嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "言笑"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430314,
					"content": "况且这些客人的要求都很明确，只要顺着思路去做就不会跑偏，真正麻烦的，还是那些让你看着办的客人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "言笑"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430315,
					"content": "请问…已经打烊了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430316,
					"content": "咦？这个声音是…我去看看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430317,
					"content": "怎么办…好像真的没人…要是我能早点过来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430318,
					"content": "没事的，现在开始准备野炊，应该也还来得及。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430319,
					"content": "是啊，而且要怪也只能怪哥哥一「采风」就忘了时间…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430320,
					"content": "啊！林尼、琳妮特、菲米尼，还真是你们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430321,
					"content": "#派蒙？那…难道{NICKNAME}也…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430322,
					"content": "你们好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430323,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙！真没想到会在这里看见你们！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430324,
					"content": "#我刚想说这句话呢，我跟{NICKNAME}是在这里帮忙啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430325,
					"content": "你们向三人说明了原委…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430326
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430326,
					"content": "情况就是这样…倒是你们，怎么会来这里？你们的…呃…「父亲」不会又给你们派了什么任务吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430327,
					"content": "恰恰相反，我们是来璃月度假的，嗯…顺便到处「采风」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430328,
					"content": "「父亲」说…前阵子我们忙了那么久，也是时候休息一下了，不然不利于下次任务…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430329,
					"content": "机会难得，加上前阵子又是海灯节，哥哥就带着我们来璃月玩了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430330,
					"content": "那林尼说的「采风」是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430331,
					"content": "我们在璃月港里看到了不少有趣的魔术…哦，在璃月，应该叫它们「戏法」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430332,
					"content": "还有人把「戏法」跟「璃月戏」、「舞兽戏」结合在一起…真的很精彩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430333,
					"content": "所以，我们就想在这儿多留几天，看看能不能多收集一些灵感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430334,
					"content": "之前还去轻策庄拜访了若心婆婆，今天也在附近采风…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430335,
					"content": "结果忘了时间，到现在都没吃上饭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430336,
					"content": "哈哈…说起吃饭，你也知道，枫丹和璃月都有不少水产，但处理它们的手法各有各的特色。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430337,
					"content": "这回难得过来一趟，不多尝试一下可不行，这也是我们逗留那么久的理由之一吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430338,
					"content": "哦哦！那你们都吃了什么？要不要听听我的推荐呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430339,
					"content": "…听名字完全不觉得辣的那个鱼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430340,
					"content": "你说的难道是…「水煮黑背鲈」？头一次听名字是会有这种误解啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430341,
					"content": "呵，当时琳妮特看着是鱼、闻着也香，毫无准备地吃了一口，结果被呛得一整天都说不出话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430342
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430342,
					"content": "还好她本来也不喜欢说话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430343,
					"content": "咕——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430344,
					"content": "（琳妮特，突然发出了夸张的声音…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430345
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430345,
					"content": "哥哥，菲米尼，你们肚子不饿吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430346
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430346,
					"content": "…是、是有点饿了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430347,
					"content": "#哈…哈哈，说的也是。那{NICKNAME}，就拜托你下厨了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430348,
					"content": "要来点什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430349
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430349,
					"content": "光看菜单上的名字，也看不出什么…既然凑巧有你在，不如就由你来推荐吧。你也清楚我们的口味，不是么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430350
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430350,
					"content": "…那我回后厨商量商量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430351
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430351,
					"content": "还有…请不要放辣，拜托了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430306,
					"content": "你快清醒一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430307
					]
				}
			]
		},
